#. module: alc_delivery_package_type_number_parcels_split
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:alc_delivery_package_type_number_parcels_split.field_stock_package_type__auto_distribute_products_in_parcels
msgid ""
"If checked, on put in pack, as many packs as the number of parcels  will be "
"created. Products will be 'equally' and 'randomly' distributed among the "
"various packs. If unchecked, only one pack will be created and all products "
"will be put in this pack. This option is if you want to create a pack for "
"each parcel but don't want to follow the content of the parcels since you "
"can put your different parcels in different locations and still know where "
"the different parts of your delivery are. This option is only available if "
"the number of parcels is greater than 1."
msgstr ""

